OL,3,GNEWSA'Ghost' city's revamp could
OL,4,Ainclude new music venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new masterplan to revamp a city
OL,7,Fincludes proposals to rejuvenate key
OL,8,Fbuildings and create another music
OL,9,Fvenue.
OL,11,FGloucester City Council has shared a
OL,12,Fblueprint that will shape the future of
OL,13,Fthe area over a 25-year period.
OL,15,FUnder the provisional proposals,
OL,16,FEastgate Shopping Centre, Lower
OL,17,FEastgate Street and The Fleece are
OL,18,Fhighlighted as key areas that could be
OL,19,Fredeveloped. There are also calls to
OL,20,Fmake the city more lively at night with
OL,21,Fa new music venue.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
