OL,3,GNEWSA'Ghost' city's revamp could
OL,4,Ainclude new music venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon Rea, who has lived in Gloucester
OL,7,Ffor 41 years, said he hopes the
OL,8,Fmasterplan includes proposals to
OL,9,Fcelebrate the city's heritage, adding
OL,10,Fsome areas currently "look like a ghost
OL,11,Ftown".
